# Terraform (infrastructure/aws) — state, plans, provider caches, and the per-environment files
# that hold or point at real account details never belong in git. `.terraform.lock.hcl` is NOT
# ignored — commit it, it pins provider versions for reproducible applies.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
**/backend.hcl
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
